      <p>After installing OpenShift Container Platform, you can configure additional devices for your cluster in an {"{"}{"{"} ibm_z_name {"}"}{"}"} or {"{"}{"{"} ibm_linuxone_name {"}"}{"}"} environment, which is installed with z/VM.</p>
